    homeworld: "Hollowfen"
    story: "Rolamo Mirehollow learned to fly before they could read on Hollowfen.\n\nKelpline Gleaners knows when the blooms of the HyperSea will open. With Rolamo aboard, your crew will be sent to harvest them while they last.\n\nThey collect shells from every port and give them away to strangers."
