    factionName: "House Verdance"
    homeworld: "Saltmere"
    story: "Briola Whistlefield grew up sorting crystals in a market stall on Saltmere.\n\nThe House Verdance keep watch over the cores the quiet domains rely on. With Briola aboard, the Wardens will ask your crew to patrol those cores, to answer when one calls for aid, and to hold it until the danger has passed.\n\nThey write letters to a sibling who never writes back."
  - key: Peveth
