    story: "Corrarin Deepreach was raised among reef gardeners on the Glass Shoals.\n\nCourt of Still Water trusts its clocks and its cores to the same few hands. With Corrarin in your crew, you will patrol the house's cores, answer its calls for aid, and retake a core another domain has seized.\n\nThey tie a ribbon on the hull for every friend lost."
