    story: "Uthael Stormdrift spent a childhood stowing away on freighters on Rimehollow.\n\nThe Order of the Slow Tide keeps vigil at shrines across the HyperSea. With Uthael aboard, your crew will be asked to hold a shrine through its vigil, and the Choir has older rites it shares only with crews it trusts.\n\nThey have never once arrived early."
  - key: Cario
