    story: "Cario Emberrest was apprenticed to a cartographer on Farshore.\n\nThe Brass Lantern Company charts the trade lanes and sells passage along them. Fly with Cario and the Consortium will give your crew dispatches to carry, and convoys to bring to the ports its lanes have left short.\n\nThey have never once arrived early."
