    story: "Tamalo Gulllight grew up in the shadow of a dead Ark on Rimehollow.\n\nThe Deepreed Stalkers hunt where the water is dangerous. With Tamalo in your crew, they will send you after vaults rumoured in the shallows, and into lairs where the fauna have grown into predators.\n\nThey hum off-key during every jump."
