    story: "Brinoix Starkeel grew up mending nets on Brackenmouth.\n\nThe Far Shoal Society sends crews where no one has been. With Brinoix aboard, your crew will be asked to survey uncharted places, and to follow chart fragments wherever they lead.\n\nThey collect shells from every port and give them away to strangers."
