    homeworld: "the Lantern Reach"
    story: "Gallara Kelpdrift spent a childhood stowing away on freighters on the Lantern Reach.\n\nThe Velvet Gill moves news between ports before anyone knows it has moved. With Gallara aboard, your crew will be sent to lift dispatches from rival ports, and to be gone before morning.\n\nThey write letters to a sibling who never writes back."
