  - key: Malimo
    callsign: 12
    starter: 1
    given: "Malimo"
    family: "Lowgate"
    speciesOne: 5
    speciesTwo: 19
    factionType: 14
    factionName: "Lifeline Corps"
    homeworld: "Brightwater"
    story: "Malimo Lowgate was raised by a choir of dockworkers on Brightwater.\n\nThe Lifeline Corps answers every distress call in the HyperSea. With Malimo aboard, your crew will be sent to derelicts with crews stranded aboard, and stay until everyone is safe.\n\nThey keep score of everything, including naps."
  - key: Samaia
    callsign: 13
