    family: "Tidethorn"
    speciesOne: 28
    speciesTwo: 29
    factionType: 15
    factionName: "Choir of the Deep"
    homeworld: "Wrackline"
    story: "Samaia Tidethorn was raised among reef gardeners on Wrackline.\n\nThe Choir of the Deep keeps vigil at shrines across the HyperSea. With Samaia aboard, your crew will be asked to hold a shrine through its vigil, and the Choir has older rites it shares only with crews it trusts.\n\nThey refuse to fly on an empty stomach."
