    story: "Kalara Lowfield spent a childhood stowing away on freighters on the Copper Reef.\n\nThe Treaty Table brings rivals to terms. With Kalara aboard, your crew will be asked to carry accords to ports and crews in a feud, and arrive while both sides are still listening.\n\nThey talk to the Ark at night and insist it answers."
