    homeworld: "Gloamwater"
    story: "Olia Ashmark was raised by a choir of dockworkers on Gloamwater.\n\nDriftnet Cooperative knows when the blooms of the HyperSea will open. With Olia aboard, your crew will be sent to harvest them while they last.\n\nThey cannot resist a dare."
