    factionType: 11
    factionName: "Spray and Spin"
    homeworld: "the Copper Reef"
    story: "Corndo Kelpweaver was apprenticed to a cartographer on the Copper Reef.\n\nSpray and Spin puts on exhibition runs wherever there is a crowd. With Corndo aboard, your crew will be invited to fly them, skimming the course for every crystal along it.\n\nThey name every vessel they fly, and apologise to it after a hard landing."
  - key: Sanuia
    callsign: 1
    starter: 1
    given: "Sanuia"
    family: "Tidewright"
    speciesOne: 37
    speciesTwo: 20
    factionType: 2
    factionName: "Order of the Last Lure"
    homeworld: "the Lantern Reach"
    story: "Sanuia Tidewright grew up in the shadow of a dead Ark on the Lantern Reach.\n\nThe Order of the Last Lure keeps a ledger of every vault field and every sighting its members have ever heard of. With Sanuia aboard, that ledger is open to your crew: vaults to open, and lairs to hunt.\n\nThey talk to the Ark at night and insist it answers."
  - key: Pendo
    callsign: 2
    starter: 1
    given: "Pendo"
    family: "Rustmark"
    speciesOne: 22
    speciesTwo: 40
    factionType: 1
    factionName: "Quayside Mutual"
    homeworld: "the Kelp Throne"
    story: "Pendo Rustmark grew up in the shadow of a dead Ark on the Kelp Throne.\n\nThe Quayside Mutual insures cargo across the HyperSea, so it needs crews to carry its dispatches and see its convoys safe to ports where trouble is brewing. With Pendo aboard, that work comes to you.\n\nThey write letters to a sibling who never writes back."
