    story: "Belko Sandcove was apprenticed to a cartographer on Wrackline.\n\nThe Deepreed Stalkers hunt where the water is dangerous. With Belko in your crew, they will send you after vaults rumoured in the shallows, and into lairs where the fauna have grown into predators.\n\nThey cannot resist a dare."
