    factionName: "Hollowfen Trackers"
    homeworld: "Brackenmouth"
    story: "Uix Whistlemore grew up mending nets on Brackenmouth.\n\nThe Hollowfen Trackers follow sightings across the HyperSea. Fly with Uix and you will hear of vault fields before other crews do, and of lairs where something has grown too large to leave alone.\n\nThey tie a ribbon on the hull for every friend lost."
