    factionName: "The Jade Accord"
    homeworld: "Lanternfall"
    story: "Mirave Hollowwatch grew up in the shadow of a dead Ark on Lanternfall.\n\nThe Jade Accord binds a dozen harbours to keep each other's cores. With Mirave in your crew, the Accord will send you to patrol them, to answer a harbour's call for aid, and to take a core back when another domain holds it.\n\nThey cannot resist a dare."
